<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SoundView starts Motorola, Nokia.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SoundView starts Motorola, Nokia.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst ALbert Lin initiated coverage of Motorola Inc and Nokia with short-term buy, long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- said expects Motorola to earn $2.67 a share in fiscal 1997 and $3.26 a share in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- said expects Nokia to earn $3.02 a share in fiscal 1997 and $3.61 a share in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
